        "richtext_MxN69U": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Originally launched in the Middle East, Noritamy rapidly gained global recognition after participating in the London Fashion Week designer showrooms.</p><p>Over the past 5 years, Nori has taken sole lead of the brand - expanding into consulting, fashion design, and the creation of home and art pieces, with an emphasis on collaborations.</p><p>Coveted in Europe, Asia, and the Middle East, Noritamy is admired for its wide range of fashion-oriented statement pieces and delicate high-end gold and diamond creations. Nori was recently awarded \"Best Sculpture-Oriented Jewelry Designer in the Middle East\" by Lux magazine.</p>"
          }
