        "image_with_text_3X97yR": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/n-story-01-by-natasha-zeriker8.1-scaled-1_f2ed228e-6e5f-45f5-a83e-f6768627154c.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Middle East to London Fashion Week",
            "content": "<p>Originally launched in the Middle East, the brand gained global recognition through the LFW designer showrooms - opening the door to buyers and press across Europe and Asia.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_4kMLEt": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/R-Colored_Z_N9214-Noritamy-Jan21-by-Natasha-Zeriker-scaled-1.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "At the helm",
            "content": "<p>For the past five years, Nori has led the brand alone, with each season unveiling a new collection and an original story to fuel her creativity. Her ability to blend art, architecture, and fashion continues to enchant the fashion world, and makes Noritamy a prominent and celebrated name in the industry.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_g8nTVa": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/editorial-3-1_4215d333-92f0-4b06-beb9-04750bbee045.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Press and stage",
            "content": "<p>Featured in UK, Paris and Italian VOGUE, Harper's Bazaar, BOF, Elle, Marie Claire, Interview, WGSN, and the Swarovski Book of Inspirations.</p><p>Top stylists and bloggers globally have been captivated by the jewelry, which has graced the likes of Marta Pozan, Caylee Cowen, Victor Perez, Nicole Scherzinger, Eugen Lee Yang, FKA twigs, Alesha Dixon, Alena Watson, Clara Amfo and more.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_bf3zEF": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Studio-Session-5804_a16b7c27-50a0-45c7-a483-25b660ee6032.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Visit the studio",
            "content": "<p>Each Noritamy piece is handmade in our studio - dipped in a heavy layer of 24k gold or silver tone, always nickel free, no two pieces ever exactly alike. Explore the collections - or come see how they're made.</p>",
